      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Dioses y asuras arrancaron el monte Mandara del suelo y lo cargaron hacia el mar.",
          "en": "Gods and asuras pulled Mount Mandara out of the ground, and carried it toward the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero pesaba demasiado. Se les cayó y aplastó a muchos de ellos.",
          "en": "But it was far too heavy. It fell, and it crushed many of them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces llegó Vishnu, montado en Garuda, su águila gigante.",
          "en": "Then Vishnu arrived, riding Garuda, his giant eagle."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Bhagavata Purana dice que con solo mirarlos les devolvió la vida a los caídos.",
          "en": "The Bhagavata Purana says he brought the fallen back to life, just by looking at them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Después levantó la montaña con una mano y la llevó al océano sobre Garuda.",
          "en": "Then he lifted the mountain with one hand, and carried it to the ocean on Garuda's back."
        }
